---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Rebecca"
  description="Learn about Rebecca L. Norrington — Happiness Specialist, certified fitness instructor, life coach, author, and podcast host. Her story of searching for happiness."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[65vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/images/howcanihelp.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/60 to-charcoal/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-28 md:pt-36 pb-16 w-full">
      <p class="text-gold text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 font-medium">About</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light text-white leading-tight tracking-tight">
        Rebecca L.<br /><em class="italic">Norrington</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/85 text-lg max-w-md">Happiness Specialist · Author · Life Coach · Retreat Host</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- My Story -->
  <section class="section-padding max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Sticky image -->
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-cream-dark shadow-xl">
          <img
            src="/images/interviewside.jpg"
            alt="Rebecca L. Norrington"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story text -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-terracotta text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 font-medium">My Story</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-light text-charcoal leading-tight mb-8">
          My Search for Happiness
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed text-base">
          <p>
            Despite outward success — a wonderful son, meaningful travels, a career I loved — I found myself quietly unhappy. On the surface, everything looked right. Inside, something essential was missing. That gap between how my life looked and how it felt became the catalyst for everything I do today.
          </p>
          <p>
            My journey taught me something that changed my life: <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">happiness is not a destination you arrive at when the right things happen. It is a practiced skill — something you develop, strengthen, and sustain through daily intention and personal responsibility.</strong>
          </p>
          <p>
            This realization didn't come easily or quickly. It came through years of practice, study, teaching, and the humbling experience of learning to apply these principles even when life was hard — especially when life was hard.
          </p>
          <p>
            I am a Happiness Specialist, AFAA-certified fitness instructor, life coach, author, and podcast host. My approach is what I call <em>RealitySpirituality</em> — a blend of the human experience and spiritual practices that meets you exactly where you are.
          </p>

          <!-- Blockquote -->
          <blockquote class="my-8 pl-6 border-l-4 border-terracotta">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-charcoal italic leading-snug">
              "Happiness is the ability to be at peace, regardless of your circumstances."
            </p>
            <cite class="text-terracotta text-sm mt-2 block not-italic">— Rebecca L. Norrington</cite>
          </blockquote>

          <p>
            I've experienced loss, uncertainty, and the kind of challenges that can leave you questioning everything. And I've found — through practice, not just theory — that sustainable happiness is achievable. Not as an escape from reality, but as a deepening into it.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, I teach others what took me years to learn. Through one-on-one coaching, group courses, fitness classes, retreats, books, and podcasts — I help people discover the inner tools they already have and haven't fully used yet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <Button href="/services" variant="primary">Work with Rebecca</Button>
          <Button href="https://calendly.com/realityspirituality" variant="outline" external>Book Free Consultation</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-cream-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Mission & Vision"
        title="What I Believe"
        subtitle="These principles are the foundation of everything I teach."
      />

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          {
            number: "01",
            title: "Happiness Is a Skill",
            body: "Like any skill, happiness can be learned, practiced, and strengthened. It is not a personality trait or a stroke of luck — it is something you develop."
          },
          {
            number: "02",
            title: "You Are Responsible",
            body: "Personal responsibility is not blame. It is the recognition that your emotional state is yours to shape — and that is a profound source of freedom."
          },
          {
            number: "03",
            title: "Reality + Spirituality",
            body: "Spiritual growth that bypasses real human experience isn't growth — it's avoidance. True peace is found by meeting life as it is, not as we wish it were."
          },
          {
            number: "04",
            title: "Peace Is Possible Now",
            body: "You don't have to wait for the right job, relationship, or circumstances to feel at peace. Peace is available to you in this moment, in this life."
          },
          {
            number: "05",
            title: "We Are Here to Learn",
            body: "Every challenge carries a lesson. When we stop resisting our difficulties and start asking what they're teaching us, everything shifts."
          },
          {
            number: "06",
            title: "Connection Heals",
            body: "Human beings are wired for connection. Genuine community, witnessed vulnerability, and shared laughter are among the most powerful healing forces available to us."
          }
        ].map(belief => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
            <span class="text-terracotta/30 font-display text-5xl font-light">{belief.number}</span>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-light text-charcoal mt-3 mb-3">{belief.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-charcoal-light text-sm leading-relaxed">{belief.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Credentials -->
  <section class="section-padding max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="Credentials"
      title="Background & Training"
      subtitle="Rebecca's work is grounded in both professional certification and lived experience."
    />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      {[
        { label: "AFAA Certified Fitness Instructor", detail: "Aerobics and Fitness Association of America" },
        { label: "Happiness Specialist", detail: "Certified practitioner and course creator" },
        { label: "Life Coach", detail: "One-on-one and group coaching" },
        { label: "Author", detail: "Published works on happiness and wellbeing" },
        { label: "Radio Host", detail: "RealitySpirituality — realityspirituality.com" },
        { label: "Retreat Facilitator", detail: "A Place to Heal Retreat, Southern Oregon" }
      ].map(cred => (
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-cream-dark">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-terracotta/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-terracotta" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-charcoal text-sm">{cred.label}</p>
            <p class="text-charcoal-light text-xs mt-0.5">{cred.detail}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-terracotta">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center text-white">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light mb-5 leading-tight">
        Ready to Start<br /><em class="italic">Your Practice?</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A free 20-minute consultation is the first step. No pressure, no commitment — just a conversation about where you are and where you'd like to be.
      </p>
      <Button href="https://calendly.com/realityspirituality" variant="gold" size="lg" external>
        Book a Free Consultation
      </Button>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
